WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:01.110
Hello.

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:03.350
With AVaraaAi account,

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.350
you can see your bookings again.

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.510
Cancel when something comes up.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.990
Collect loyalty stamps and

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:11.670
message your salon.

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:16.550
Creating an account takes one minute and it's completely free.

00:00:17.463 --> 00:00:19.433
On varaai.com

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:22.713
Tap Sign up in the top right corner

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.113
on the page. Create your account.

00:00:25.543 --> 00:00:27.673
Enter your full name, email,

00:00:28.023 --> 00:00:28.793
phone number,

00:00:29.143 --> 00:00:31.433
a password, and the password.

00:00:31.543 --> 00:00:32.313
Once more

00:00:32.823 --> 00:00:37.113
below. Choose whether you'd like to receive offers by email or by

00:00:37.063 --> 00:00:38.073
text message.

00:00:38.503 --> 00:00:40.393
Then tap Create account.

00:00:41.398 --> 00:00:45.528
Next time, tap sign in and enter your email and password.

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:50.168
If you've forgotten your password, tap Forgot password,

00:00:50.518 --> 00:00:54.408
type your email and tap Send Reset link.

00:00:54.838 --> 00:00:58.728
Then open the email and follow the steps to choose a new password.

00:00:59.401 --> 00:01:02.971
Once you're signed in, tap your name at the top to open the

00:01:03.961 --> 00:01:04.971
My profile,

00:01:05.481 --> 00:01:06.331
My bookings,

00:01:07.081 --> 00:01:08.171
loyalty cards,

00:01:08.681 --> 00:01:09.451
inbox

00:01:10.121 --> 00:01:10.571
following

00:01:11.241 --> 00:01:12.171
and feed

00:01:13.081 --> 00:01:15.371
in My profile. You can change your photo,

00:01:15.961 --> 00:01:18.331
your email and your password.

00:01:19.001 --> 00:01:19.771
That's it.

00:01:20.361 --> 00:01:21.851
Now take the quiz below.
